@startuml
' Cost formula comparison focused on accounting equations
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam dpi 180
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #1F2937
  FontColor #111827
}
skinparam arrow {
  Color #334155
}

title Cost Formula Comparison: Replica vs MILP-ECnew

legend right
|= Color |= Meaning |
|<#FDE68A>| Replica formula |
|<#86EFAC>| MILP-ECnew formula |
|<#DBEAFE>| Shared mechanism |
|<#F5D0FE>| Runtime accumulation |
|<#FECACA>| Final aggregate |
endlegend

rectangle "Shared Metric Engine\n_updateTransferMetric(graph, req, effectiveSize)" as Shared #DBEAFE
rectangle "Per-edge transfer term\nedgeCost * effectiveSize * partitions/numPartitions" as EdgeTerm #DBEAFE

rectangle "Replica effectiveSize\nread: req.size\nwrite: req.size per copy" as RepSize #FDE68A
rectangle "MILP-ECnew effectiveSize\nread: req.size/EC_K (EC object)\nwrite: req.size/EC_K per shard" as EcSize #86EFAC

rectangle "Transfer Cost Accumulator\ntracker.addTransferCost(metrics.cost)" as TransferAcc #F5D0FE
rectangle "Request Cost (read)\ntracker.addRequestCost(priceGet(readRegion))" as ReadReq #F5D0FE
rectangle "Request Cost (write)\ntracker.addRequestCost(sum pricePut(placedRegion))" as WriteReq #F5D0FE

rectangle "Storage Settlement\nRegionManager.remove/calculateRemainingStorageCosts\ncost = pricePerGB(duration) * sizeGB" as StorageSettle #DBEAFE
rectangle "Storage Accumulator\ntracker.addStorageCost(aggregateStorageCost)" as StorageAcc #F5D0FE

rectangle "Total\ntotalCost = totalTransfer + totalRequest + totalStorage" as Total #FECACA

RepSize --> Shared : effectiveSize input
EcSize --> Shared : effectiveSize input
Shared --> EdgeTerm : per-edge billing
EdgeTerm --> TransferAcc : sum over edges

ReadReq --> Total : request component
WriteReq --> Total : request component
TransferAcc --> Total : transfer component
StorageSettle --> StorageAcc : settled storage cost
StorageAcc --> Total : storage component

note bottom of EcSize
MILP-ECnew requires SimulatorV3 path\nso placement/read sizes are delegated to policy.
end note

@enduml
